<title>ESTONIA: Q1 REAL ESTATE, BUILDING SALES UP 29 PCT.</title>
<headline>Q1 REAL ESTATE, BUILDING SALES UP 29 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real estate and building sales were up by 29 percent in the first quarter of 1997 compared to the same period of 1996, the statistics office said on Thursday.</p>
<p>According to attested purchase-sales agreements from notaries, 6,854 agreements for both buildings and real estate were concluded in the first quarter of 1997, the statistics office said in its monthly bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
